<title>MACEDONIA: NATIONAL BANK OF MACEDONIA FIX FOR MONDAY.</title>
<headline>NATIONAL BANK OF MACEDONIA FIX FOR MONDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SKOPJE 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Macedonia</p>
<p>(NBM) fix for Monday:</p>
<p>    DEM 100 - 2,663.4229	USD   1 -  43.5097</p>
<p>    CHF 100 - 3,068.9290	ATS 100 - 378.4458</p>
<p>The NBM calculates the denar's rate against the German mark on the basis of the information submitted by banks during the morning. Denar rates against other currencies are worked out from the Frankfurt fixing rates, issued around 1500 local time.</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-328101</p>
